From: Hummingbird <hummingbird@redhat.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bump klauspost/compress v1.19.1->v1.20.2 for CVE-2026-116591

Keep in sync with go-vendor-tools.toml's matching pre_command. The updated
vendor tarball (Source1) carries the v1.20.2 vendor tree and
vendor/modules.txt; this patch updates only go.mod and go.sum.

CVE-2026-116591: crafted zstd input panics DecodeAll and the streaming
decoder via a bad normalized FSE count.

